# Frontend UI/UX — Single Pane

Design of record: `work/SONNET_UI_VISION.md`. Enforceable subset; if code disagrees, fix the code. Do not touch `backend/`.

## Pane and lenses

One always-mounted pane. `HudWorkspace` (`casual|monitor|engineering`) maps 1:1 to lenses `converse|watch|bench` via `lensFor()` — never a fourth value. Lens presets (`LENS_LAYOUT`, `LENS_THEME`, `LENS_SUBSTRATE`) only; never mount/unmount or conditionally render panels by lens. Every instrument is `<PanePanel id>` inside `<Dock>`; no one-off panels in `OrchestratorShell`. Visibility is depth 0–3 via `DEPTH_VARIANTS` in `lib/pane/springs.ts` only. `OrchestratorShell` must not subscribe to `paneStore.lens` (zero shell commits per lens change).

## Motion and substrate

One WebGL context in `frontend/src/substrate/` (worker + shim); never a second context or DOM `EvilEye`/`Particles`/`LightRays` in the pane. **`motion`**: panel layout FLIP and depth variants only. **GSAP** (`lib/pane/conductor.ts`): root CSS variables, field/vignette, worker `post()`. Never both on the same property. Springs/constants only from `lib/pane/springs.ts`. Banned: `setTimeout`/`setInterval` choreography; `backdrop-filter` except `Overlay.tsx`; `AeroShards`. Lens changes start all voices at t=0 and must be interruptible.

## State and bench

`lib/pane/paneStore.ts` external store (`useSyncExternalStore`); no lens in React context or turn FSM. Heavy work gates on `useLensSettled()`. Bench: `stage`, `strip`, `sheet` only; tabbed sheet, not stacked cards. Provenance glyphs ● ◉ ◐ ○ — no guess numerals. Proof strip mirrors `quote_verify`; Authorize / Reject only. `DrawingViewer` wrapped by `DrawingStage`, not forked.

## Canvas

`/canvas` (`CanvasShell`) stays a separate route with its own boards API. It is not a fourth lens and is not part of the pane. The single-pane rules above govern `OrchestratorShell` only. Leave the board as its own surface.
